  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "In 2016-17 the Ethereum Foundation hired @cure53berlin for a security Audit of Mist. The process was eye opening and contributed to the discontinuation of the project. The report was never publicized but it might still be valuable for builders today: https://t.co/7mIs1sBCri",
  "lang": "en"
