  "created_at": "Fri Sep 11 18:16:34 +0000 2020",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Mist was a brainchild of Gavin and Jeff but I took the lead of it when I joined the foundation in 2014. We had grand plans for it being the realization of all web3 technologies we were building and it was planned as the main software release of Metropolis\nhttps://t.co/OdOiWnLsuw",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
