  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "As a designer I had spent a lot of time working on small things that I was really proud of, for instance instead of the URL being a simple text field we wanted to show all the url elements in a proper hierarchical order. But turns out Meteor’s SafeString wasn’t that safe. https://t.co/iWJgZEWCNx",
