  "created_at": "Fri Sep 11 18:22:28 +0000 2020",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "A lot of the exploits were abusing long strings to hide information that could be used to phish the user, or things that didn’t even cross our minds, like “we can actually make a draggable object from your site overtake elements from the UI”. We were impressed. https://t.co/34GfqiaLTZ",
