  "full_text": "I wouldn’t have thought about the report again, if it wasn’t for @Jordancoin pinging me about it, wanting to learn more what we learned ourselves and it made me realize these lessons could be applied to more people building desktop wallets in crypto.\n\nSo I’m sharing it now.",
